========================================================================
RESIDUAL (measured, not a rebuild)
========================================================================

Dirty `std/os/fs.oo` L171–172 calls builtin `oo_fs_rmdir`.
Dirty compiler sources list that name (`tc_names_known.oo`, `tc_call_ret.oo`,
`c_emit_*`). Live ELF is older (03:56) than those edits (04:00).
This lane was told not to start `ci_product`. Check therefore used the
pre-rmdir ELF. `sh.oo` and the f20 harness fail because they import `fs.oo`.

Do not say the builtin is missing from the tree. Do not say a rebuild
would pass. That was not measured.

